": {"ver": "8c3b5ab5b766e7253bbc316a7c309416ef97c3b1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "KookYn9404/KOOK_ImageCompression", "Node name for S&R": "KOOK_ImageCompression"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE", "links": [312, 330, 332, 337], "label": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [64], "inputs": [{"name": "tiles", "link": 305, "label": "tiles", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "tiles"}, {"name": "positions", "link": 214, "label": "positions", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "positions"}, {"name": "original_size", "link": 215, "label": "original_size", "type": "TUPLE", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "grid_size", "link": 216, "label": "grid_size", "type": "TUPLE", "localized_name": "grid_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "padding"}, "name": "padding", "label": "padding", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "padding"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TTP_Image_Assy", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [265.716796875, 118], "pos": [254.10577392578125, -243.43399047851562], "id": 125, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_ttp_toolset", "ver": "1.0.5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TTP_Image_Assy"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模型地址：\nhttps://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n\nseedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n\nnone：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\ncpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\ncuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n\n适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n需要设置 offload_device\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n\n0：已禁用（默认）\n1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [620.6390380859375, 641.826171875], "pos": [642.0497436523438, 276.7098388671875], "id": 183, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [236.6765899658203, 92.20175170898438], "color": "#332922", "pos": [-532.2854614257812, -589.89013671875], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 185, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "SeedVr", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_fcsty_00001_llkmc_1766047431.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.20681689477463494&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI1NmVmMmU3ZTdlOGViZjQyM2E2N2JiNGYxNzEzZTY3OCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NjY2NTIwMzUyODIsInRzIjoxNzY2MDQ3MjM1MjgyLCJzaWduIjoiNWM4NzQ2MWJkYWMzOWI0ZDhhMTg3MGJiZTMyMzgzNTEifQ==&Rh-Identify=56ef2e7e7e8ebf423a67bb4f1713e678"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_fcsty_00002_rlhkh_1766047438.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.3467613706642224&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ